        "prompt": "Create a single 2D forest-edge game sprite with true transparent background. Use reference 1 only for elevated game perspective and references 2-5 for outline weight and forms. THREE overlapping round broadleaf trees, large rear middle tree and two smaller front trees, two small attached shrubs, no ground slab. Same rounded tree silhouette as reference 4. STRICTLY ONLY THREE FLAT GREEN PAINT SHAPES for every tree: light #8dbb48, mid #4e873d, shadow #28563b. THREE FLAT BROWN PAINT SHAPES for trunks: #a56b37, #79502d, #4c3525. Dark brown #3a291e outline. No layered scallops in 5 or 6 shades. No gradients, no soft shading, no airbrush, no glow, no yellow highlights, no detailed wood grain or rings, no fine texture. All light-facing forms upper-left. Bold chunky shapes that remain clear at 32px. Final square sprite will be 384x384, outlines about 9px at that final size (1.5px when reduced to64). Center with transparent margins. No text, no symbols, no UI, no layout or background."
